💦 rl toy bridge 💙

an basic bridge for opensim and lovense toy connect.

My API based on https://github.com/natc0d3s/love_connect.git
For information look here: https://github.com/natc0d3s/love_connect

what you need, to host your own version. 
Lovense developer token
external webserver with PHP
My script [AV]rlToyAPI 1.0
AVSitter
patterns notecard with name: [AV]rltoybridge
And add the following lines into the AVPos notecard



TOMENU RL TOYS💙

MENU RL TOYS💙
BUTTON Login|74355

BUTTON Vibe ON|74377
BUTTON Vibe OFF|74366
